### Login para obter o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40001/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### InsertAnimal
POST http://localhost:40001/insertAnimal HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "Animal Teste",
    "datanasc": "2022-03-10"
}

### GetAllAnimal
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllAnimal HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetAnimalByID
GET http://localhost:40001/getAnimalByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### UpdateAnimal
PUT http://localhost:40001/updateAnimal/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "nome": "Animal Teste Alterado",
    "datanasc": "2022-04-15"
}

### DeleteAnimal (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:40001/deleteAnimal/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetAllAnimal depois do delete (o registro removido não deve aparecer)
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllAnimal HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Teste sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllAnimal HTTP/1.1
